# iCloud Drive sync duplicates. This repository lives in a synced folder,
# and a fast rebuild can race the sync into leaving "name 2.js" beside
# "name.js" — which Eleventy will happily publish as a page and Playwright
# will happily collect as a spec.
* [0-9]*
* [0-9]*.*
